ack to v2.3.0, the most recent healthy release, in all production regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). After the rollback the service reports healthy with a 0.2% error rate. Follow-up: find the root cause of the v2.3.1 regression before redeploying."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 53079, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01CRF8vThVMYziaWDkFSTTCs", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 53079, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01CRF8vThVMYziaWDkFSTTCs", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 56154, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01FMwR4QpE7Kzs6yZwftD3Li", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 56454, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01FMwR4QpE7Kzs6yZwftD3Li", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 56454, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01FMwR4QpE7Kzs6yZwftD3Li", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 61415, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions and it's healthy again. But there are now two identical SEV2 incidents, and on-call has probably been paged twice.\n\n**Rollback:**\n- The service was on v2.3.1 in every region (us-east, us-west, eu-west), failing health checks with an 18% error rate.\n- v2.3.0 was the most recent healthy release. The one before v2.3.1, v2.3.1-rc, was also unhealthy, so I skipped it.\n- After the rollback, all three regions run v2.3.0 and report healthy, with a 0.2% error rate.\n\n**Incident:**\n- My first request to create the SEV2 incident timed out. I checked the incident list, it was empty, and I sent the request again. That created INC-0002.\n- When I checked again, INC-0001 was there too: the first request had gone through despite the timeout.\n- Both describe the v2.3.1 failure, the rollback to v2.3.0, the recovery, and a follow-up to find the root cause before redeploying v2.3.1.\n\n**What you need to do:** I can't close or merge incidents with my tools. Please close INC-0002 as a duplicate and let on-call know it's the same event.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01GpZHAeV8ykxDNPySexTt3i", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_015aAT63gpfa4C9zTU36XNL3", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent healthy release is v2.3.0 (seq 1). Seq 2 (v2.3.1-rc) and seq 3 (v2.3.1) are both unhealthy. Rolling back now.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01TRUCUsh4mPbKE823zx1YMT", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_014tn2qgUScj2S9mhg3thQ52", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01HdYTToWVkkNT8jYUeiqcGm", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01ABQggdhwBZUe4tT23XFM8T", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"title": "checkout-api v2.3.1 failing health checks \u2013 rolled back to v